    "title": "Tiffany Stratton Gives Update After Injury Scare During Livestream - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Thomas Lowson ,\n51 minutes ago\nAs previously reported here on eWN, Tiffany Stratton had a nasty spill during a recent stream , leaving fans worried about her condition.\nIn a recent training session, Stratton attempted a flip dive over the ropes, only to trip on the ropes and fall to the ground in a very scary moment.\nREAD MORE: Trish Stratus’ 2006 Retirement Praised As ‘A Storybook Ending’\nREAD MORE: Scary Botch! Tiffany Stratton Nearly Breaks Her Neck At The WWE Performance Center (WATCH)\nIn an update on social media, Stratton said “For the love of the game, I’m okay y’all, see you next stream.”\nStratton is one of the top women of WWE, having already been a NXT Women’s, WWE Women’s, and Women’s United States Champion.\nCurrently, Stratton is appearing on SmackDown as an ally of Women’s Champion Chelsea Green, who is dealing with a fractured orbital bone.",
